### C8 - ORDER WORKFLOW

@base = http://localhost:18080

### 1. Register Admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Chủ cửa hàng",
  "email": "owner@shop.test",
  "password": "Owner@123456"
}

### 2. Login Admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@shop.test",
  "password": "Owner@123456"
}

### 3. Register Customer A
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Khách hàng A",
  "email": "customer@shop.test",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 4. Login Customer A
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@shop.test",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 5. Register Customer B
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Khách hàng B",
  "email": "customer-b@shop.test",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 6. Login Customer B
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer-b@shop.test",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 7. Create Product - Stock 10
POST {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DEMO-C8-001",
  "name": "Sản phẩm Demo C8",
  "description": "Kiểm thử luồng đặt hàng và tồn kho",
  "price": 100000,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### 8. Create Order - Stock 10 -> 8
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_A_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Nguyễn Văn Khách",
  "recipientPhone": "0901234567",
  "shippingAddress": "Số 1 Đại học Quốc gia Hà Nội",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": PRODUCT_ID,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 9. Get Order
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_A_TOKEN

### 10. Customer B Cancel - Owner Check
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_B_TOKEN

### 11. Customer A Cancel - Stock 8 -> 10
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_A_TOKEN

### 12. Cancel Again - 409
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_A_TOKEN